        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......呵，我也沒什麼資格說就是了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "抱歉，你這杯威士忌就讓我來請客好了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（什麼這原來不是免費的嗎？！）",
