      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "怎麼樣，喜歡這個新興的城市嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "我最喜歡的就是她這樣，稚氣未脫但是蓬勃成長的樣子。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是本地人嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "我並不是在這裡土生土長，但是這裡現在就是我的家。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "為了守護這裡，我可以付出很多東西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "不管是哪裡的人，對於家人的感情都是一樣的不是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "保鏢",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
          "text": "頭兒，克洛寧先生找你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......知道了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "我還有工作，先走了，陌生人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "希望你可以也喜歡上這個城市。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "真是個奇怪的人。",
